{"id":94,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>رَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>َ وِزْرَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نق</span>َضَ ظَهْرَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ مَعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ مَعَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نص</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْغَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">ب</span> <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"}]}